		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A statue made of transparent ice, formed in the rough shape of a man.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 17, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +3 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Golem</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from acid, cold, electricity, or non-magical sources. Double damage from any fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shard Blast</strong>. When reduced to 0 HP, explodes in icy blast, near-sized cube centered on golem. DEX 12+ or 1d8 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
